    {
      "index": 4,
      "className": "csp-story",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "One of Bangladesh's largest telecom operators launching a data pack aimed at students and first-job users."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The operator's brand content was polished and ignored. Under-25s skipped it in two seconds. The brief was reach and recall for one pack, with a cost per view the media team would sign off."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A creator-style series: short, scrappy, shot on phones, with real students",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Twelve episodes cut into 60+ shorts for YouTube, Facebook and Instagram",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "YouTube and Meta campaigns optimised for ThruPlay and view rate, not clicks",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Weekly creative rotation based on the retention curve of each episode",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "A single landing page for the pack, tracked end to end",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "4.1 million views in six months at a cost per view 58% below the operator's previous campaign, with pack activations tracked to the videos."
        }
      ]
    },
